            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Obesity now rivals smoking as one of the leading preventable causes of cancer. Obesity-associated neutrophilia is now shown to enhance breast cancer metastasis and to be reversible through dietary modification and weight loss.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
